meta {
  name: Payment Status (Confidence)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/payment/v2/payments/{{paymentId}}/status
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  GPI Payment Status Track and Trace. Run "Global Payments - Send RTP
  (Confidence).bru" first so `paymentId` is set.

  Note: this collection's `baseUrl` points at the Prism mock-server, which
  synthesizes a response straight from the OpenAPI spec - it won't step
  through statuses. The stepping "debug mode" (RECEIVED -> ACCEPTED ->
  PROCESSING -> COMPLETED, one step per call) is a feature of the app's own
  in-browser MSW mock (`app/client/src/mocks/handlers.ts`), not this
  collection - use the app's Payments page "Track this payment" button to see
  that live.
}
